### Inscription avec OneSignal Player ID
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marie",
  "lastName": "Curie",
  "email": "marie.curie@example.com",
  "phone": "+237698765432",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "role": "CITIZEN",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso",
  "oneSignalAppId": "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012"
}

### Inscription Agent avec OneSignal
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Agent",
  "lastName": "HYSACAM",
  "email": "agent.hysacam@example.com",
  "phone": "+237677777777",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "role": "AGENT",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso",
  "oneSignalPlayerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Inscription Agent avec tokens
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Agent",
  "lastName": "HYSACAM",
  "email": "agent.hysacam@example.com",
  "phone": "+237677777777",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "role": "AGENT",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso",
  "fcmToken": "fcm_token_agent_1234567890abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ",
  "oneSignalPlayerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Inscription sans tokens (fonctionnalité existante)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "phone": "+237600000000",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "role": "CITIZEN",
  "neighborhood": "Bonapriso"
}

### Vérifier l'inscription (après OTP)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "code": "123456",
  "purpose": "VERIFY_EMAIL"
}

### Connexion sans OneSignal App ID (fonctionnalité existante)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Connexion avec OneSignal App ID
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marie.curie@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "oneSignalAppId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### Connexion Agent avec OneSignal App ID
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent.hysacam@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "oneSignalAppId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333"
}

### Vérifier le statut des tokens après connexion
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/status
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

### Tester une notification push
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/device-tokens/test
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

{
  "title": "🎉 Test après inscription",
  "body": "Votre FCM token a été enregistré avec succès !"
}
